{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"香港與智利簽工作假期協議　李家超︰成本港首個拉丁美洲伙伴國家\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/CE-CHILE-261118-19.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】行政長官李家超下午又與智利總統卡斯特會面，見證簽署設立雙邊工作假期計劃協議，雙方每年各有100個名額。李家超指，很高興智利成為本港第一個拉丁美洲伙伴國家，相信協議可擴闊兩地青年視野，進一步促進兩地人文交流，為兩地的雙邊友好關係注入新動力。</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T13:24:06.387427+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T12:38:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T04:57:12.902479+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T13:17:34.175955+00:00","content_hash":"f7032e40af1f66cbd5428a72d1d1dc507cb9dbec085e06244844cfb2914e6051","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T13:24:06.387427+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}